5:["$","article",null,{"className":"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 prose prose-slate","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"The Fastest Path from Research Question to Breakthrough"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-slate-500 not-prose","children":"2026-05-26"}],"$Ld"]}]
d:[["$","p",null,{"children":["Every biomedical research program has the same bottleneck. It isn't the lab. It isn't even the funding. It's the ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"weeks-to-months"}]," between asking a good question and knowing which experiment to run first."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"FastScience! has been attacking that bottleneck for decades. Version 7, the version powering kwiKBio today, is the first that closes the loop end-to-end inside a single working session."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"The four levers"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"We get the speed from four compounding ideas, none of them new on their own:"}],"\n",["$","ol",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Causal graphs over corpus search."}]," We do not search papers — we ingest them into a Neo4j graph of entities and causal arcs. The arcs are what matter."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Sub-linear association mining."}]," Higher-order k-tuple correlation discovery (a SLAM-style approach drawing on the academic work of Evan Steeg and others) finds non-obvious co-clusters at scale that is sub-linear in the corpus size."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"PRISM-9 reduction."}]," Most well-posed research problems decompose into ≤9 dominant entities. We force that reduction explicitly — it makes the next layer QUBO-tractable."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Quantum-class solving."}]," With the problem reduced, path-planning becomes a Quadratic Unconstrained Binary Optimization. Quantum annealers address it in seconds where available; classical fallback in minutes."]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"What it looks like in practice"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"A typical user session:"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Drop a research question into the Gateway."}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Watch PRISM-9 identify the 9 dominant entities — often with surprises."}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Inspect the Cube-27 expansion to see which sub-factors are coupled."}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Receive a ranked list of experiment proposals. Book a matched CRO directly from the same screen at the Pro tier and above."}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Working sessions that previously consumed weeks of senior-researcher attention now resolve in hours, and the SSKM (Studied System Knowledge Model) persists, so the second pass is faster than the first."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"What is still hard"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Domain manual ingestion. If your field does not have a clean RDF/Turtle representation already, we have to build one with you. That is why Enterprise customers get a named success engineer for the first quarter."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Try it"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Freemium gives you five queries a month, no card. Start at ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/pricing","children":"/pricing"}],". The first question is on us."]}]]
